    description: Interstages, diameter adapters, nose cones and avionics bays.
    parts:
    - title: Interstage Decoupler
      image: {fileID: 0}
      shortDescription: 7 sizes in AscendCAD. Joins two stages and separates them with pneumatic pushers.
      purpose: 'Joins two stages and separates them with pneumatic pushers. Everything above it is the next stage. Room inside for avionics. Stacks on top of or under other parts.


        Bigger sizes hold more but weigh and cost more; match the diameter of the parts above and below it.'
